      "message": "Phllipp: Thank you for making an extra effort to make your new tests pass under `CONFIG_INTERNAL_STATS\u003d1`. You may have discovered that not all tests in test/encode_api_test.cc work correctly when `CONFIG_INTERNAL_STATS` is equal to 1.\n\nThere is just one final comment. Otherwise this looks good.",
